        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARLYOCOM, Parthenon Front Door Lock with Black Glass Lyon Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Parthenon Entryset with Lyon Knob has a vintage style that makes it a great choice for historic buildings. The ornate detailing on the Parthenon Plate paired with the alluring sensibilities of the Glass Lyon Knob make this a must have for adding elegance to any front door. The Parthenon Front Door Lock with Black Glass Lyon Knob is a single cylinder lock; and it will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Parthenon Plate with Lyon Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Entrance Set with Lyon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Lyon Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Lyon Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.34\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARLYOCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARLYO Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
